			REPLACE_TEXTUALLY CASE_SENSITIVE EXACT_MATCH ~Replace_Death_in_NOT_Valid~ ~~~~~Replace_Death_in_NOT_Valid

			SPRINT textToReplace ~!I[s|f]ValidForPartyDialog\(ue\)?("%Death_var%")~
